WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
narrator: Start a throwaway key-generation container.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
narrator: Clear the scratch directory, then run client initialization.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
narrator: List the generated files.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
narrator: Generate a demonstration bond key and inspect the directory.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
narrator: Identity prints a wallet address; it does not register it.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
narrator: Remove the fixture; this tape transfers no funds.
